  "description": "Kanject Core events abstractions — the transport-neutral contract a Library publishes product events on: [EventTopic] and [EventJsonContext], IEventPublisher over a validated EventEnvelope, EventMetadata and the EventHeaders every transport writes, and the per-container IEventCatalog of generated EventDescriptors. Depends only on the BCL and Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions. Typed publishers are generated by Kanject.Core.Events.Annotations; the in-process default publisher is Kanject.Core.Events.",
